{
  "id": "DEU.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Obwijukiro 18",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abakuhani abalevita, nirwo ruganda rwona rwa Levi, tibaligira mushondo anga busika muli Isiraeli; baralyaga ebihongo by'okwokibwa ebihongeirwe Omukama n'ebyo basaine kuhabwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibaligira busika mu barumuna babo; Omukama niwe busika bwabo nk'okwo yabaraganisize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi nibyo abantu baragiirwe kuha abakuhani, abalikutamba ekitambo: K'eliba eli nte anga ntaama, bahe omukuhani omukono n'enshaya zombili n'orubunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engano eyo muliganuza, kwakwo n'edivai n'amajuta, n'obwoya bwa mbere bw'entaama mubibahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga wanyu abaronzire omu nganda zanyu zona kuba bakuhani bakamukolera, bonene na baijukuru babo ebiro byona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omulevita wena wena ayakwenda, yakuruga omu kigo kyona kyona omuli Isiraeli mbali alikutura, aija mbali Omukama alironda kufukamirwaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akora nk'omukuhani w'Omukama Ruhangawe, nk'Abalevita batahibe bona ab'alikukolera Omukama halinya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabwe ekyakulya ekigaine n'eky'abakuhani abandi, eky'ab'omuka balikumutwekera kitabulimu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Orwo muligoba omu nsi ey'Omukama Ruhanga wanyu alikubaha, mutalyega michwo mibi ey'amahanga ago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana banyu mutalibatamba bitambo bya kwokibwa. Mutaligira mbandwa anga omuteki w'enshoga, anga omushazi w'enkoko, anga omurogi, anga omukonikoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anga omufumu, anga alikwehanuza aha bafire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'okuba wena wena akora ebintu ebi ahemukira Omukama; mara aha rw'enshonga y'emigilire egi ey'obuhemu, nikyo Omukama alikubingira amahanga ago orwo mulikutaha omu nsi yago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mube nyakatetere aha Mukama Ruhanga wanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba amahanga aga ago muli haihi kunyaga gakwata eby'abateki b'enshoga n'embandwa; kyonkai inywe ebyo Omukama Ruhanga wanyu talikubajubura kubikora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa abagambira ati, “Omu Baisiraeli barumuna banyu Omukama Ruhanga wanyu alibaihiramu omurangi, ogwo mulimuhuliliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'okwo mwashabire Omukama Ruhanga wanyu ahali Horebu aha kiro ky'enteko, muti, ‘Tutashubira kuhulira iraka lya Mukama Ruhanga waitu anga kubona muliro gungi guti ogu, tutaija tukafa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akangambira ati, ‘Ebyo bagamba bagamba kurungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu Baisiraeli barumuna babo ndabaihiramu omurangi nka iwe, muragire eby'aragamba, mara arabibagambira byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omuntu arayanga kuhulira ebigambo byange ebyo aragamba omw'ibara lyange, inye nyenene ndamubonabonyia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai omurangi aralengesa kugamba ekigambo omw'ibara lyange ekyo ntamuragiire kugamba, anga aragamba omw'ibara lya baruhanga abandi, omurangi ogwo afe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwija kwebaza muti, ‘Turamanya tutai ekigambo eky'Omukama atagambire?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo omurangi aragamba omw'ibara ly'Omukama, k'ekigambo kiraba kitabaireho anga kitabairekwo, ekyo nikyo kigambo eky'Omukama araba atagambire; omurangi araba akyetumire, mutamutina.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
